<title>GERMANY: Preussag details results by division.</title>
<headline>Preussag details results by division.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified German engineering group Preussag AG gave the following breakdown of its divisions' contributions to group income from ordinary activities in the year ended September 30, 1996. No comparison figures were immediately available:</p>
<p>    Steel and nonferrous metals	 5 pct</p>
<p>    Energy and raw materials	   36 pct</p>
<p>    Transport and logistics	    33 pct</p>
<p>    Factory and shipbuilding	    4 pct</p>
<p>    Building tech and components     22 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Chairman Michael Frenzel said all divisions showed positive overall results.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
